{"4049620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Weasel Wes's Cycling Simulator", "steam_appid": 4049620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weasel Wes's Cycling Simulator is a 2D indoor cycling simulator that connects to your indoor sensors and bike trainers. <br><br>An ANT+ or Bluetooth Compatible sensor or indoor bike trainer is required.<br><br>Sensor Capabilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controllable - Control the resistance of the indoor bike trainer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power - read power as provided by a power meter or sensor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cadence - read cycling cadence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed - read cycling speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HeartRate - read heart rate sensor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin your legs in a freeride session! Or choose a workout! Make your own workouts in the integrated workout editor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload directly to Strava (Strava account required)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tested Bike Trainers:<br>- Elite Suito<br>- Wahoo Kickr Core</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weasel Wes's Cycling Simulator is a 2D indoor cycling simulator that connects to your indoor sensors and bike trainers. <br><br>An ANT+ or Bluetooth Compatible sensor or indoor bike trainer is required.<br><br>Sensor Capabilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controllable - Control the resistance of the indoor bike trainer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power - read power as provided by a power meter or sensor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cadence - read cycling cadence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed - read cycling speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HeartRate - read heart rate sensor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin your legs in a free